# The image build reads pyproject.toml, README.md, LICENSE and src/ and nothing
# else. Allow-listing them keeps the context small, keeps job traces in the
# corpus out of it, and means a stray local file can never end up in an image.
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!src/

# Even inside src/, never ship interpreter or tool droppings.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
